    "CI_HEALRECEIVEDDAMAGE_DESC": "<style=cIsDamage>受到伤害</style>时，在15秒内<style=cStack>（每层-15%）</style><style=cIsHealing>恢复</style>相当于<style=cIsDamage>所受伤害</style>20%<style=cStack>（每层+5%）</style>的生命值。",
    "CI_HEALRECEIVEDDAMAGE_LORE": "",
    "CI_INFINITESECONDARYSKILLCHARGES_NAME": "无限弹匣",
    "CI_INFINITESECONDARYSKILLCHARGES_PICKUP": "提高次要技能的伤害并获得无限充能。将多余的充能转化为额外的次要技能伤害。",
    "CI_INFINITESECONDARYSKILLCHARGES_DESC": "使用<style=cIsUtility>次要技能</style>时无需最低充能要求。施放技能时消耗所有<style=cIsUtility>次要技能</style>充能，每消耗一层充能使<style=cIsUtility>次要技能</style>的<style=cIsDamage>伤害</style>提高<style=cIsDamage>100%</style>。造成任何<style=cIsUtility>次要技能</style><style=cIsDamage>伤害</style>后，额外的<style=cIsUtility>次要技能</style><style=cIsDamage>伤害</style>会<style=cDeath>消失</style>。使<style=cIsUtility>次要技能</style>的<style=cIsDamage>伤害</style>提高<style=cIsDamage>100%</style><style=cStack>（每层+100%）</style>。",
    "CI_INFINITESECONDARYSKILLCHARGES_LORE": "",
    "CI_DRAWSPEEDPATH_NAME": "粉笔",
    "CI_DRAWSPEEDPATH_PICKUP": "移动时绘制一条提高移动速度并赋予飞行能力的路径。",
    "CI_DRAWSPEEDPATH_DESC": "移动时绘制一条路径。处于该路径上时，<style=cIsUtility>移动速度</style>提高<style=cIsUtility>50%</style><style=cStack>（每层+50%）</style>并<style=cIsUtility>获得飞行能力</style>。最大路径长度：512 <style=cStack>（每层+128）</style>。",
