    "CI_REFINERY_OBJECTIVE_BUILDING_FIRST": "建造管道。至少需要建造 {2} 条管道才能启动<style=cHumanObjective>现场精炼厂</style>（{0}/{1}）",
    "CI_REFINERY_OBJECTIVE_BUILDING": "建造管道。可以启动<style=cHumanObjective>现场精炼厂</style>（{0}/{1}）",
    "CI_REFINERY_OBJECTIVE_READY": "<style=cHumanObjective>现场精炼厂</style>已准备就绪，可以启动",
