    "CI_DIFFICULTY_HURTMEPLENTY_NAME": "痛扁我吧 (Hurt Me Plenty)",
    "CI_DIFFICULTY_HURTMEPLENTY_DESC": "这才是操控 Doomguy 游玩本作的正确方式！扮演 Doomguy 击败最终首领即可为所有幸存者解锁此难度，并为 Doomguy 解锁其余难度（目前此功能尚未实装）。<style=cStack>\n\n怪物投射物速度：<style=cIsHealing>-35%</style>\n怪物飞行高度：<style=cIsHealing>8米</style>\n精英怪：<style=cIsHealing>移除</style>\n击退：<style=cIsDamage>移除</style>\n无人机、物品与装备：<style=cIsDamage>重新分配</style>。<style=cIsHealth>-75%伤害。无法眩晕、感电、定身和冰冻</style>\n怪物：<style=cIsHealth>不以随从为目标</style>\n重型怪物生命值：<style=cIsHealth>+60%</style>\n首领怪物生命值：<style=cIsHealth>+120%</style>\n3D打印机与收割机：<style=cIsHealth>移除</style>\n虚空与月球物品：<style=cIsHealth>移除</style>\n弱小怪物：<style=cIsHealth>移除</style>\n受击硬直：<style=cIsHealth>移除</style></style>",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_BODY_NAME": "Doomguy",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_BODY_SUBTITLE": "毁灭战士或者带来毁灭的家伙之类的吧",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_NAME": "Doomguy",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_DESC": "他就是那个 Doomguy！",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_SHOTGUN_NAME": "战斗霰弹枪",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_SHOTGUN_DESC": "发射霰弹，造成<style=cIsDamage>5x120%伤害</style>",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_SPEAR_NAME": "长矛挥击",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_SPEAR_DESC": "挥动长矛造成<style=cIsDamage>200%伤害</style>。<style=cIsUtility>招架</style>袭来的<style=cIsHealing>可招架</style>攻击与投射物。<style=cIsHealing>成功招架</style>时获得<style=cDeath>赋能</style>并<style=cIsUtility>缩短辅助技能的冷却时间</style>",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_ACCELERATOR_NAME": "等离子加速器",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_ACCELERATOR_DESC": "发射等离子弹体，造成<style=cIsDamage>50%伤害</style>。持续射击会使加速器超载，将等离子弹体伤害提高至<style=cIsDamage>125%伤害</style>。松开扳机时释放超载能量，造成<style=cIsDamage>500%伤害</style>",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_DASH_NAME": "冲刺",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_DASH_DESC": "向移动方向<style=cIsUtility>冲刺</style>",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_SPEARSPECIAL_NAME": "长矛赋能",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_SPEARSPECIAL_DESC": "为长矛准备<style=cDeath>赋能</style>。使用时消耗5层<style=cDeath>赋能</style>。\n\n主要技能：投掷长矛造成<style=cIsDamage>2000%伤害</style>。爆头时必定<style=cIsDamage>暴击</style>并造成<style=cIsDamage>超级眩晕</style>。\n\n次要技能：开发中\n\n辅助技能：向下猛跃，对<style=cIsUtility>24米半径</style>内造成<style=cIsDamage>700%伤害</style>",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_PUNCH_NAME": "重拳",
    "CI_DOOMGUY_PUNCH_DESC": "痛击目标造成<style=cIsDamage>800%伤害</style>。若目标处于<style=cDeath>失衡</style>状态，则不消耗充能，并根据目标级别恢复<style=cIsHealing>3.125%/12.5%/25%</style>最大生命值与<style=cIsHealing>10%/25%/50%</style>储备治疗量，同时获得<style=cDeath>赋能</style>"
  }
